  "description": {
   "en": "Is this BL...?! This is a selection of youth drama masterpieces, with three currently difficult-to-find short stories (total of 28 pages) added to the legendary debut book by the author of \"Areyo Hoshikuzu\"! Is this BL...?! \n\n• Kaneda Junko (Boys' Love researcher): \"It loosens up and connects gay comics and BL. A hidden gem!\"\n\n• Masuno Koichi (Poet): \"The only manga that gets me excited is about a man who is the complete opposite of a man of great sexual prowess!\" A stylish boy and a bear-like boy, a cute girl and a clumsy boy? A brilliant artist presents five stories of \n\nglamorous adolescent comedies in all! Included works: \"Toothpaste of Love and Youth,\" \"The Young General of the Health,\" \"Hello☆Ao General,\" \"Teenage Sex Guide,\" and \"Steamy with Youth\""
  },
